# Hall of Storm Giants: "If you control two or more other lands, this land enters tapped" (CR 614.1d). On turn 3 Bot1 has one
# other land (an Island) and Bot2 has an Island, which does not count ("you control"): the first Hall enters untapped and
# taps for {U}. On turn 5 Bot1 has two other lands (Island, first Hall): the second Hall enters tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Hall of Storm Giants
Hall of Storm Giants
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Hall of Storm Giants.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Hall of Storm Giants.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Hall of Storm Giants.Activate(Ability: Add)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Hall of Storm Giants.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Hall of Storm Giants#1.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Hall of Storm Giants#2.Tapped = true
